{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026z95ihiE5RS1795420147.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有調查指，投資者認為退休，要有逾920萬元儲蓄。</p><p></p><p>滙豐最新《現代財富報告》，訪問10個市場共9,900多位富裕及高淨值投資者，當中香港投資者退休儲蓄目標平均達119萬美元，即逾928萬港元，較去年調查高百分之7，不過只有四成半完成目標，由於財務需求增加，難以填補相關缺口，高達七成七投資者預期，以逐步或彈性方式退休，而非直接停止工作。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:54:08.612782+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T07:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T09:37:17.126690+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T08:47:28.331205+00:00","content_hash":"1c8cd80263f7732102861403b0566b48220ac8b9a8c7bb22dde14a0587d95f13","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:54:08.612782+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}